    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σβεσ-τήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ον </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ph.
			1.350
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>serving to
			quench</i> or <i>put out</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωλύματα
				[πυρὸς] ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.53
			</span></i>: as Subst., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σβεστήρια τοῦ πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.56
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. κακοῦ φάρμακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					<u>All.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἰάματα</span> (for a fever) <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				3.6
			</span></i>.</div>
